= The Assassination of Narutowicz

Narutowicz, first elected President of **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>**, only five days upon taking office qas fatally shot three times during his visits at the Zachęta gallery by <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Niewiadomski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="portraits/NiewiadomskiEligiusz.jpg">Eligiusz Niewiadomski, a modernist painter and right-wing sympathizer</span></span>. 

Niewiadomski has now been arrested and is currently on trial.

Let's hope the judicial system doesn't fail us...
